# The oldest macOS this plugin runs on. It is newer than the shared minimum
# (scripts/lib/macos-minimum) because the plugin bundles the onnxruntime release
# pinned in scripts/fetch-onnxruntime.sh, whose prebuilt libonnxruntime.dylib
# records a minimum of macOS 14.0. A prebuilt library cannot be built for an
# older system, so this is the plugin's real minimum. Lower it only together
# with an onnxruntime release built for an older macOS.
14.0
